- Section entrance: fade + 12px slide-up, 60–80ms stagger, once, via IntersectionObserver.
- Hero: auto-advance 6–8s, crossfade + slight scale (1.0→1.03), 600ms, pause on hover, manual control resets timer, stop when tab hidden.
