- Buttons 120ms hover; pressed scale .97. Segmented toggles slide (~250ms). Drawers/modals fade + scale-from-98% (desktop) / slide-up (mobile sheets), 150–250ms.
- Reader: smooth chrome fade, no heavy page-turn animations beyond a short slide on mobile swipe [U].
- Skeleton shimmer 1.5s loop in real shapes (cover rects, text bars, chapter rows).
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`. Do not add effects not listed.

